   ],
   "replyText": "That's great — drawing gives us lots to talk about in English! I'm putting a few sentence starters on the screen to help you. Try one: \"I like to draw because...\" What would you say after \"because\"?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "I draw cats and dogs.",
   "startT": 20541,
   "endT": 23726,
   "audioSec": 3.19,
   "replyAudioLatencyMs": 2733,
   "replyTextEventLatencyMs": 2596,
   "heard": "I draw cats and dogs.",
   "heardMessages": 1,
   "transcriptLatencyMs": -101,
   "queries": [
    {
     "status": 200,
     "firstContentMs": 2063,
     "totalMs": 3036,
     "chars": 210
    }
   ],
   "replyText": "Nice sentence, well done! \"I draw cats and dogs\" is correct. Let's grow it a little. I'm putting a new sentence on the screen with a gap. Can you fill it in: \"I draw cats and dogs, and I usually draw them ___\"?"
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "My pencil is green.",
   "startT": 39350,
   "endT": 42026,
   "audioSec": 2.68,
   "replyAudioLatencyMs": 2253,
   "replyTextEventLatencyMs": 2095,
   "heard": "Eye pencil is green.",
   "heardMessages": 1,
   "transcriptLatencyMs": -99,
   "queries": [
    {
     "status": 200,
     "firstContentMs": 1584,
     "totalMs": 2410,
     "chars": 237
    }
   ],
   "replyText": "Good try, but \"eye pencil\" isn't quite it. For drawing you'd say \"pencil\" or \"coloured pencil\", and because you like drawing, the sentence is \"I like to draw with a green pencil.\" Say it once with me, then tell me: what do you draw with?"
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "I show my mom my pictures.",
   "startT": 58549,
   "endT": 61913,
   "audioSec": 3.36,
   "replyAudioLatencyMs": 2086,
   "replyTextEventLatencyMs": 1888,
   "heard": "I show my mom my pictures.",
