     "firstContentMs": 1518,
     "totalMs": 2203,
     "chars": 164
    }
   ],
   "replyText": "That's a lovely sentence, and it's correct! \"I show my mom my pictures\" works well. Quick check: who do you show your pictures to, and what does she say about them?"
  }
